Sonic the Hedgehog (Master System) - v@VERSION@

Supply your own supported ROM (CRC32 B519E833). No ROM is included.
Open Play.cmd to select your original ROM, or drag the ROM onto Play.cmd for normal native resolution or Play 16x.cmd for faithful 16x GPU output. Normal audio is enabled.
You can also run: @EXE@ path\to\sonicthehedgehog.sms --window 3 --internal-scale 16

Controls: arrows move, Z/X buttons, Enter Start, Esc quit.
Original tile artwork is preserved with no smoothing or invented detail. Unsupported GPU drivers fall back to native output.

